  "releaseNotes": "v2.2.0 - Trim and NativeAOT safe (IsTrimmable, IsAotCompatible, IL warnings are build errors); component types carry DynamicallyAccessedMembers(All), as Blazor's own Renderer APIs do. On SpawnDev.SpawnJS 3.0.0. The test suite passes on a fully trimmed publish (TrimMode=full).",
